 RenderStepped walkspeed modifier that bypasses default Humanoid speed limits.\n• Safe Noclip Engine: Automatic collision management during flight routines with clean physics resets upon landing.\n​⚙️ UI, Performance & Security\n• Extreme Optimization: Built-in 1-click potato graphics mode (disables shadows, post-processing, textures, particles) for maximum FPS.\n• FPS Unlocker: Built-in 999 FPS cap bypass for supported executors.\n• Panda Auth V4: Streamlined Key System with instant clipboard copying and direct menu loading upon validation.\n• Modern Tabbed GUI: Fully draggable, minimizable interface with smooth tween animations and color-coded active toggle buttons.","tags":["Ride A Pet"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/THcCYygrh","keyLink":"https://ads.pandauth.com/getkey/relaxhub","owner":{"_id":"6aa3f42789eda2969d71cbf2","username":"Relaxspeezy","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"6aa3f42789eda2969d71cbf2","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSherlock","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-08T17:34:14.449Z","profile":"/u/QueueSherlock"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-23T00:42:03.404Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6ab5517ccbb43dac9d1a3b29","editBy":{"_id":"6aa3f42789eda2969d71cbf2","username":"Relaxspeezy","status":"offline","id":"6aa3f42789eda2969d71cbf2"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-09-24T16:36:12.840Z"},{"_id":"6ab83a8657b05ba78fa6a091","editBy":{"_id":"6aa3f42789eda2969d71cbf2","username":"Relaxspeezy","status":"offline","id":"6aa3f42789eda2969d71cbf2"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-09-26T21:35:02.772Z"